## Baseline — fpq-baseline (main@7e3d2e6)

The baseline image has no `fastpostgres.orm`, so it reports the stock ORM
control and the materializer as unavailable.

| run | driver tuples | stock ORM |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | 216.8 ns/row (4.61M) | 3349.9 ns/row (0.30M) |
| 2 | 210.9 ns/row (4.74M) | 3373.4 ns/row (0.30M) |
| 3 | 213.6 ns/row (4.68M) | 3387.0 ns/row (0.30M) |
