```
### ORM MATERIALIZE
rows: 100000  reps: 5  shape: bench
engine: postgresql+fastpostgres://postgres@/postgres?host=/tmp
driver tuples            213.6 ns/row     4.68M rows/s
stock ORM               3373.4 ns/row     0.30M rows/s
